This package is modified to work with Lexmark Z33 printer.
Copyright (c) 2005 Vitaly V. Bursov <vitalyvb.ukr.net>

Original README follows

-----------------------------
The Lexmark X74 All In One is a printer and a scanner in a single box.

This driver was written to allow me to use my X74 as a printer connected
to my GNU / Linux computer. I had no ambitions of addressing the scanner.
I have heard rumors that there is a software system called "Sane" that
is used to connect scanners to GNU / Linux systems, but I am hard at hearing
and I do not know any more about that.

